@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Login Admin
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@ifx.test", "password": "Admin123!" }

### Login con clave incorrecta
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@ifx.test", "password": "mala" }

### Login con email inválido
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "no-es-email", "password": "" }

### ¿Quién soy?
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Cookie: {{login.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### ¿Quién soy? sin cookie
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout

### CORS origen permitido
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Origin: http://localhost:5173

### CORS origen no permitido
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Origin: http://sitio-malicioso.com